&lt;p style="margin-left: 96px; text-align: left; text-indent: -60px"&gt;④　実績：6.4時間（2023年度実績。総受講時間1,488時間÷期初従業員数231名）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: left"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

</jpcrp030000-asr_E01529-000:StrategyMetricsAndTargetsTextBlock>
  <jpcrp030000-asr_E01529-000:ReferenceToOtherInformationStrategyMetricsAndTargetsTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">2023中期経営計画</jpcrp030000-asr_E01529-000:ReferenceToOtherInformationStrategyMetricsAndTargetsTextBlock>
  <jpcrp030000-asr_E01529-000:DescriptionOfMetricsRelatedToPolicyOnHumanResourceDevelopmentAndImprovementOfInternalEnvironmentAndTargetsAndResultsUsingSuchMetricsStrategyMetricsAndTargetsTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
